ECMWF chart viewer
==================

Weather charts produced by this project are derived from ECMWF open data.

Data source
-----------
ECMWF IFS open data (HRES, 0.25 deg), https://data.ecmwf.int/forecasts/
and its cloud mirrors (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud).

